{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"_kritt_extractor_helper\":true,\"stub\":true,\"stub_explanation\":\"No supported vulnerability was found. Raffle.releaseSponsorPrize enforces eligible status, an unclaimed prize, and a reentrancy guard. The caller cannot change the configured token, token ID, or recipient. A transferFrom failure at Raffle.sol:404 propagates and atomically rolls back the claim flag, guard changes, and nested effects, leaving the release retryable without blocking independent cash claims or refunds.\",\"results\":[]}"}}
